        "at": "2026-08-23T18:11:53"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "METHOD-1",
      "narration_text": "Here's my favorite move. I pasted our real playlists into Claude and asked it to cluster them by viewer intent, not project. React and Lyrical Literacy for beginners. Mycroft and NeuroVEP for practitioners. Fellows and Madison for decision-makers. The gaps are where our architecture is weak.",
      "shot": {
