      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "WORKED-EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "Our HAI playlist is a hundred and forty-one videos in one pile: shipped tools, learning topics, and explainers, all mixed together. Split it into three real playlists, and each one finally has an audience.",
